--- E2c: block-diagonality of M'^2 (exhaustive n=4; off-diag block formula) ---
off-diag (1,2) block of M'^2 = (a+d) * (b M^2 + beta M); diag of that = -b(a+d)(n-1)
(+1,+1,+1,+1)  a+d=+2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(+1,+1,+1,-1)  a+d=+2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(+1,+1,-1,+1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(+1,+1,-1,-1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(+1,-1,+1,+1)  a+d=+2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(+1,-1,+1,-1)  a+d=+2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(+1,-1,-1,+1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(+1,-1,-1,-1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(-1,+1,+1,+1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(-1,+1,+1,-1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(-1,+1,-1,+1)  a+d=-2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(-1,+1,-1,-1)  a+d=-2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(-1,-1,+1,+1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(-1,-1,+1,-1)  a+d=+0  formula exact: True   BLOCK-DIAG (all T)
(-1,-1,-1,+1)  a+d=-2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
(-1,-1,-1,-1)  a+d=-2  formula exact: True   never block-diag
=> M'^2 block-diagonal <=> a+d=0 <=> trP=0: exactly the D_skew orbit (8 members).

--- E2d: orbit laws for M'^2 (exhaustive n=4) ---
orbit B  (trP=0):  M'^2 = I2 (x) (2M^2 - I)            [Chebyshev T2]: True
orbits A,C (trP=+-2): M'^2 = (trP)*(I2 (x) M)*M' - I   [boost pencil]: True
   (I2(x)M commutes with M'; quadratic relation M'^2 - (trP)(I2(x)M)M' + I = 0)

